# PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT PROPOSAL - OPTION 2: MULTI-INSTITUTIONAL ERP
**Project:** ANDPOC Unified Multi-Institutional Academic & Bursary Mobile ERP  
**Target Entities:** ANDPOC Royal Schools (K-12) & ANDPOC Universal Study Center (Higher Education)  
**Target Delivery:** Cross-Platform Student/Parent/Staff Mobile App (Android & iOS) + Multi-Role Web Admin & Bursary Dashboard  
**Prepared By:** Sales Cowboy Marketing Solutions  
**Date:** November 18, 2026  

---

## 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE
To engineer a complete academic management mobile app and web ERP built specifically to handle the structural differences between **K-12 term-based schooling** (ANDPOC Royal Schools) and **credit-unit/semester-based tertiary education** (ANDPOC Universal Study Center) in one unified system.

This tier encompasses **all foundational features from Proposal Option 1** (Dual-wing mobile hub, digital admissions engine, curriculum directory, Paystack/Moniepoint checkout, and push notifications) while adding complete academic report generation, automated bursary reconciliation, and staff management portals.

---

## 2. FUNCTIONAL SYSTEM MODULES

### Module 1: Complete Foundational Ecosystem (All Features of Proposal Option 1)
* **Dual-Wing Institutional Hub:** Separate mobile wings for Royal Schools (K-12) and Universal Study Center (University).
* **Digital Curriculum Directory:** Full syllabus prospectus for Nursery, Primary, Secondary, and Tertiary education.
* **In-App Admission Intake:** Digital candidate registration, passport/credential uploads, and status tracking.
* **Mobile Payment Engine:** Instant card, transfer, and USSD payments via Paystack / Moniepoint with digital receipts.
* **Real-Time Push Notifications:** Instant broadcast alerts to parents and students for campus announcements and schedules.
* **Central Web Admin Desk:** Applicant review, curriculum configuration, and transaction ledgers.

### Module 2: Dual-Architecture Academic & Result Engine (Option 2 Expansion)
* **K-12 Engine (ANDPOC Royal Schools - Nursery, Primary, Secondary):**
  * Class and arm allocations (JSS1-SSS3, Primary 1-6, Nursery).
  * Continuous Assessment (CA 30% / 40%) + Examination score entry by subject teachers.
  * Behavioral, affective, and psychomotor trait ratings with teacher/principal remarks.
  * Automated **Termly Report Cards** generated as downloadable, watermarked PDFs viewable inside the mobile app.
* **Tertiary / Study Center Engine (ANDPOC Universal Study Center / Andpoc University):**
  * Faculty, Department, and Level management (100L - 400L+).
  * Semester course registration and credit-unit weighting.
  * Automated **GPA and CGPA computation** (5-point Nigerian university standard) with digital transcript and result sheet previews.

### Module 3: Bursary & Automated Fee Reconciliation (Option 2 Expansion)
* **Dynamic Multi-Tier Fee Structures:** Configure distinct tuition, lab, development, and uniform fees across classes and study centers.
* **Dedicated Virtual Bank Accounts:** Automated virtual account numbers generated per student for instant bank app transfers with automatic reconciliation.
* **Debtor & Revenue Ledger:** Real-time financial dashboard tracking collected fees, outstanding balances, partial payments, and defaulter lists.

### Module 4: Multi-Role Web Admin & Staff Management (Option 2 Expansion)
* **Super-Admin Master Console:** Comprehensive cross-campus oversight of enrollment figures, student performance, staff roles, and institutional cash flow.
* **Teacher & Lecturer Portal:** Attendance registers, assignment distribution, continuous assessment uploads, and syllabus tracking.

